--- !u!114 &880386515935185847
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2112612984793089729}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 993d8d8b34a954049b05eb7b4bbba012, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game::Npc
  npcName: Digby
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e8a1f26ccb5944f3d91026b2556c01c4, type: 3}
  voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cb0ce38f252a041c3baec6a8bc0c658c, type: 3}
  giftSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a142d3c7adcfa46989d2fae3161d654d, type: 3}
  conversations:
  - requires: 
    notIf: met:Digby
    sets: met:Digby
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    takeItem: 
    smallTalk: 0
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Well, dig me sideways! A visitor! Digby's the name, foreman of the Glimmer Mines. Mind the bats, they've no manners.
    - heroSpeaks: 1
      text: Why is it so dark in here?
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: The Grey Gloom's gloom, that's why. It put out every lamp in the mine, and moles can't see a thing without a lamp.
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: 'Three of my crew wandered off into the tunnels when the lights went out: Molly, Mortimer and Mo. They''ll be lost and a bit scared.'
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Find all three and tell them to come home, {hero}, and I'll have a surprise for you. Try the dark tunnels, east of here.
  - requires: moles_found>=3
    notIf: thanked:digby
    sets: thanked:digby
    giveGold: 40
    giveItem: 
    takeItem: 
    smallTalk: 0
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: There they are! Molly, Mortimer and Mo, safe and sound! I could hug you, {hero}. And I'd better, with these paws.
    - heroSpeaks: 1
      text: Is everyone all right?
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Right as rain, and twice as muddy. Here, a little something for your trouble. Forty coins!
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: 'And I''ve cleared the rubble off the old mine-cart line. Climb in any cart and press E: it rattles you down the line from the Entrance to the Tunnels to the Crystal Cavern, and round again.'
  - requires: thanked:digby
    notIf: digby:golem
    sets: digby:golem
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    takeItem: 
    smallTalk: 0
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: 'Now, listen. Past the Crystal Cavern is the Golem''s Chamber, and Rocky lives there. He''s a lovely lad, really, only grumpy: the Gloom got into his crystals.'
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: 'His crystals glow, then go dark, then glow again. Hit him while they GLOW: when they''re dark, his hide is like a mountain.'
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: And when it goes dark, the whole cave does. That Fairy Lantern of yours would be handy, if you have one.
  - requires: cleared:Mines4
    notIf: digby:cheered
    sets: digby:cheered
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    takeItem: 
    smallTalk: 0
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: 'The mine''s gone quiet! You did it! Rocky''s himself again. Oh, and look: he left the Mole Mitts.'
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Wear 'em and lean on a big stone block, and you can shove it along. Press E at a mound of loose soil to dig it up.
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Plenty of those about the island, I'd wager. Blocks too. Funny how you only spot 'em when you can do something about 'em.
  - requires: 
    notIf: moles_found>=3
    sets: 
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    takeItem: 
    smallTalk: 0
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: 'Three of them, {hero}: Molly, Mortimer and Mo. Try the tunnels, east of the entrance. Bring a light!'
  - requires: 
    notIf: 
    sets: 
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    takeItem: 
    smallTalk: 1
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Why did the mole bring a ladder to work?
    - heroSpeaks: 1
      text: Why?
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: To get to the top soil! Heh heh heh. Oh, I'm good.
  - requires: 
    notIf: 
    sets: 
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    takeItem: 
    smallTalk: 1
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: A mole's favourite music? Anything with a good BASS-ment. Haha!
  - requires: dirt_dug>=3
    notIf: 
    sets: 
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    takeItem: 
    smallTalk: 1
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Dug up three mounds already? You've a natural talent, {hero}. Ever think of a career in the soil trade?
  - requires: 
    notIf: 
    sets: 
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    takeItem: 
    smallTalk: 1
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Mind the carts. Last week one rolled off on its own. Nobody was in it. Spooky, eh?
  talkOffset: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
  flipbook: {fileID: 3669984664585661365}
  idleFrames:
  - {fileID: 250808276, guid: acec5bb4086234be18d6166be98d6196, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -833592835, guid: acec5bb4086234be18d6166be98d6196, type: 3}
  talkFrames:
  - {fileID: 493651777, guid: acec5bb4086234be18d6166be98d6196, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 1351821173, guid: acec5bb4086234be18d6166be98d6196, type: 3}
  idleFps: 2
  talkFps: 6
